{"steam_appid":2174560,"steam_name":"Bus Flipper: Renovator Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2174560/1257546924/68bcf1070f051497a12da27870e0ab4e8b4271ac/1766048467/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771520576","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257251988/d4f28f56b2f577ee8cc18ff78b5cbe251258c3f8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771520576","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/c9e51fbe9cc3de795404d31ca532803de11d7855/ss_c9e51fbe9cc3de795404d31ca532803de11d7855.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784621632","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/17512da3dca1635b92820337653c3ed7b0fe97d7/ss_17512da3dca1635b92820337653c3ed7b0fe97d7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784621632","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/25a848fb3035bdf7775b84d431e072298f475bf2/ss_25a848fb3035bdf7775b84d431e072298f475bf2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784621632","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/1476bd551182be23726e6666fb10d349a944bcb2/ss_1476bd551182be23726e6666fb10d349a944bcb2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784621632","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/dcd805032405e0c0982a1ba9ac0b2dd7c5962a92/ss_dcd805032405e0c0982a1ba9ac0b2dd7c5962a92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784621632"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME THE RENOVATION MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every forgotten bus in the scrapyard deserves a second chance. Take on renovation tasks from old friends and ambitious clients, transforming piles of rusty metal into stylish motorhomes or cozy mobile cafes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/bf289afdc69b32b8952f8cd0febe0fb2.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLEAN EVERYTHING AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the meditative rhythm of work as you wash away layers of dust. Dirty work becomes a satisfying hobby the moment you hear the steady hum of a renewed engine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/3a3f7d22f148f0afbb8d7aac3a402937.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PUT YOUR HEART IN YOUR DESIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill the interior with comfort and just go with the vibe. Choose furniture and materials to create the kind of atmosphere you would never want to leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f4248b8c9216bfb635239d7fd06351f5.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY THE CHILL RIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once the tools are put away, the road is yours to explore. Free ride through beautiful landscapes and soak in the quiet beauty of the world passing by you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⠀</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f45c35f7f6744b27c9af1c0e495feea8.poster.avif?t=1784621632\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f45c35f7f6744b27c9af1c0e495feea8.webm?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174560/extras/f45c35f7f6744b27c9af1c0e495feea8.mp4?t=1784621632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3 series or FX 8000 series<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8196 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 960 or AMD R9 290<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Is a product to change</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><